{
  "package": "text/template",
  "notes": "text/template: Template is a handle (clone = copy of Go's *Template; Clone is clone_template, New is associated). Execution runs over the typed Value model in text::template::value instead of reflect; data comes from the ToValue trait and functions from Value::func_of or the func0..func4/variadic builders. Funcs and Option panic on bad input like Go; strings are UTF-8; variadic arguments reach callables flattened; ParseFS takes any io::fs::FS (DirFS, MapFS, embed::FS) with fs.Glob semantics.",
  "symbols": {
    "ExecError": {
      "rust": "rust_stdlib::text::template::ExecError"
    },
